  "guardrail": "McGaugh 2019 table2 is a published Milky Way mass model with separate bulge, gas and disk circular-speed components; table3 is a published circular-speed curve with asymmetric statistical errors. Baryonic-model systematics and shared radial gradients remain confounders, so detrended and first-difference correlations are more diagnostic than raw correlations. This is an independent cross-check, not a persistence detection."
